    "result_text": "The full test suite passes. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `contactPreference` field so the owner API returns `'EMAIL'` when an email is present, otherwise `'PHONE'`.\n\nSince DTOs are generated from the OpenAPI spec at build time (via the `openapi-generator-maven-plugin`), the change spans two files:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `contactPreference` property (a string enum of `EMAIL`/`PHONE`) to the `Owner` schema, following the same style as the existing derived fields like `membershipLevel` and `locality`. This generates `OwnerDto.ContactPreferenceEnum`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added an `@AfterMapping` method `addContactPreference` that sets `EMAIL` when the owner has a non-empty email, `PHONE` otherwise \u2014 matching the existing MapStruct `@AfterMapping` pattern used for the other presentation-only fields.\n\nVerification:\n- `AcceptanceTest.corePhoneWhenNoEmail` \u2014 owner with no email \u2192 `PHONE` \u2705\n- `AcceptanceTest.functionalityEmailWhenPresent` \u2014 owner with email \u2192 `EMAIL` \u2705\n- Full test suite: `Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**",
